# Docs sync

When you change journeys, IA, mock contracts, or prototype scope, update the matching file under `docs/inputs/` in the same PR when practical.

| Change | Update |
| --- | --- |
| New / dropped journey | `03-priority-journeys.md` |
| Screen or nav change | `04-ia-and-screens.md` |
| Fixture shape | `05-mock-data-contracts.md` |
| New feasibility finding | `08-feasibility-questions.md` |
| Success bar change | `09-success-metrics.md` |

Do not silently promote deferred journeys (J4–J6) into the running app. Non-goals in `01-concept-brief.md` still apply.
